<div id="history-panel">
<p class="intro">Each race&rsquo;s best round, race by race: as a share of one competitor&rsquo;s in the same race (axum&rsquo;s, or the one picked below), or as req/s. A line that jumps is a commit, or another CPU under the same size: each race&rsquo;s data, <code>/data/runs/ID.json</code> (the ID is on each point), names both. The <a href="/data/index.json">index</a> lists the races.</p>
{{?waiting}}<p class="pending">// HISTORY NEEDS TWO RACES // check back after the next nightly</p>{{/waiting}}{{^waiting}}<nav class="tabs bases" aria-label="Plot as">{{#bases |base|}}<a href="#history-panel" data-on:click__prevent="{{ base.action }}"{{?base.current}} aria-current="page"{{/base.current}}>{{?base.swatch}}<span class="swatch s-{{ base.name }}"></span>{{/base.swatch}}{{ base.label }}</a>{{/bases}}</nav>
{{#classes |class|}}<div class="strips">
{{#class.charts |chart|}}{{> HistoryChart}}{{/class.charts}}</div>
{{#class.h2c |chart|}}<div class="h2c">{{> HistoryChart}}</div>
{{/class.h2c}}{{/classes}}{{/waiting}}</div>
